{meta title='Books and magazines', about='The ISBN of a book as its barcode, written above the bars, the price in an add-on of five digits; a magazine with the issue in an add-on of two.'/}
<div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:28px; align-items:flex-end">
